/**
 * @mainpage DspCore
 *
 * DspCore is the signal-processing layer of the RoModular ecosystem: lookup
 * tables, interpolation, generators, filters and transforms for desktop and
 * embedded targets, built on Foundation.
 *
 * @note Version 0.1.0 is the scaffold; features arrive in the phases of
 * `ACTION_PLAN.md`.
 *
 * @section DspCoreMainModules Modules
 *
 * - @ref DspCore_Core "Core": DspCore and Foundation version information.
 * - @ref DspCore_Filters "Filters": runtime-order FIR and IIR processors,
 *   configured by portable coefficient values and Biquad designers.
 *
 * @section DspCoreMainDependency Dependencies
 *
 * DspCore links `Foundation::Foundation` (Foundation 2.0.10 or a newer 2.x
 * release, built on CPSTL 1.1.12). It uses local
 * packages when available and otherwise fetches the pinned release from
 * GitHub; see @ref DspCore_BuildGuide_Dependency.
 */
